      "en": "Code calling `date.today()` inside gives a different result every day and the test fails tomorrow. Make it take `today` as a parameter with a default (like `last_month(today)` in week 20). `pytest --cov=mytools` (the pytest-cov package) shows which lines no test touches — a sensible target is 80% for the important functions, not 100% of everything."
